{"candidate_id": "52913742f95c786d619b3df37b54776ea82545b9", "source_type": "x", "tweet_id": "637707571898417152", "created_at": "2025-12-22T01:56:25.503145", "published_at": "", "text": "We used to think about what we lack. Nevertheless the most productive works are usually made by the focus on limited resources.", "score": 3}
